ange` for controlled\nstate. The callback receives a boolean. Use the Accordion component to coordinate several sections;\nin that composition, manage expansion through the group."},"485":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-32","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Use `className` and `style` to customize each component. Button supports string or state-based\n`className` values. Components expose these data attributes for state-based styling:"},"486":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-33","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"`Collapsible`: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`, and `data-focus-visible-within`."},"487":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-34","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Trigger `Button`: `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, and `data-disabled`."},"488":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-35","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"`CollapsiblePanel`: `data-focus-visible-within`."},"489":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-36","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"Key"},"490":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-37","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"Action"},"491":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-38","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"`Tab` / `Shift + Tab`"},"492":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-39","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"Mo