cast against the actual for that pair, wrapped in the default styled popover."],[2048,"`renderTooltip` example styled as a period-over-period comparison card. Paired series\n(solid current period + dashed previous period) share a `colorIndex`; hovering either\nline shows both dated values and the percent change, wrapped in the default popover."],[2046,"`renderTooltip` lets you render a fully custom tooltip and know which curve is\nhovered. Paired series share a `colorIndex`; hovering either line shows a\ntooltip specific to that line, wrapped in the default styled popover."],[966,"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"],[1072,"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"],[582,"`role=\"dialog\"` with `aria-modal=\"true\"` on the drawer panel (via RAC Modal)"],[749,"`role=\"img\"`: When title prop is provided"],[748,"`role=\"presentation\"`: For decorative icons"],[445,"`role=\"progressbar\"` on the container"],[1120,"`role=\"progressbar\"` on the container"],[1222,"`role=\"radio\"` on each option"],[1347,"`role=\"radio\"` on each segment"],[1221,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1346,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1782,"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` → `role=\"toolbar\"` on container, `role=\"button\"` + `aria-pressed` per item"],[248,"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` lets each Card toggle on its own. CardSelectionIndicator shows the\nstate, and its children can render custom content from it. Nested buttons keep their own presses."],[1781,"`selectionMode=\"single\"` → `role=\"radiogroup\"` on container, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` per item"],[249,"`selectionMode=\"single\"` keeps one Card selected at a time. Arrow keys move between Cards, and\nSpace selects the focused one."],[924,"`size` controls item density. Shown here as two standalone menus so both\nsizes are visible at once; in practice you set `size` on the `Menu` inside a\n`MenuTrigger`."],[1625,"`size` picks